Package: phBudgetPAPBrowser
Title: Philippine Budget P/A/P Browser
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Shiny dashboard for browsing Program/Activity/Project level
    figures from the Philippine National Expenditure Program and General
    Appropriations Act, FY2020-FY2027.
